graph TB
    subgraph WVA["WVA Controller Manager"]
        direction TB

        subgraph Controllers["Read-Only Controllers"]
            HPAReconciler["HPA Reconciler"]
            SOReconciler["ScaledObject Reconciler"]
            CMReconciler["ConfigMap Reconciler"]
            IPReconciler["InferencePool Reconciler"]
        end

        subgraph Engines["Scaling Engines"]
            SatEngine["Saturation Engine<br/>(V1/V2/Queueing Model)"]
            SFZEngine["Scale-From-Zero Engine<br/>(100ms polling)"]
        end

        subgraph Pipeline["Optimization Pipeline"]
            CostOpt["Cost-Aware Optimizer<br/>(unlimited mode)"]
            GreedyOpt["Greedy-By-Score Optimizer<br/>(limited mode)"]
            Limiter["GPU Limiter<br/>(Inventory / Quota)"]
        end

        subgraph Collectors["Metrics Collection"]
            Collector["Metrics Collector"]
            PodScraper["Pod Scraper"]
        end

        Datastore["In-Memory Datastore"]
        DecisionCache["Decision Cache"]
        GPUDiscovery["GPU Discovery"]

        Controllers -->|populate| Datastore
        Collector -->|feeds| SatEngine
        SatEngine -->|decisions| DecisionCache
        SatEngine -->|constrained by| Pipeline
        SFZEngine -->|reads| Datastore
    end

    subgraph Actuators["Actuators"]
        MetricsActuator["Metrics Actuator<br/>(wva_desired_replicas)"]
        DirectActuator["Direct Actuator<br/>(scale subresource patch)"]
    end

    DecisionCache -->|emits via| MetricsActuator
    SFZEngine -->|patches via| DirectActuator

    %% External Resources Watched
    HPA["HPA<br/>(autoscaling/v2)"]
    ScaledObject["KEDA ScaledObject"]
    ConfigMap["ConfigMaps<br/>(saturation-scaling,<br/>scale-to-zero,<br/>queueing-model)"]
    InferencePool["InferencePool CR"]
    Nodes["Kubernetes Nodes"]

    HPA -->|watched by| HPAReconciler
    ScaledObject -->|watched by| SOReconciler
    ConfigMap -->|watched by| CMReconciler
    InferencePool -->|watched by| IPReconciler
    Nodes -->|labels read by| GPUDiscovery

    %% External Dependencies
    Prometheus["Prometheus /<br/>Thanos Querier"]
    K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]
    vLLM["vLLM Servers"]
    SGLang["SGLang Servers"]
    EPP["EPP<br/>(Endpoint Picker)"]

    Prometheus -->|metrics queried by| Collector
    vLLM -.->|scraped by| PodScraper
    SGLang -.->|scraped by| PodScraper
    MetricsActuator -->|exposes to| Prometheus
    DirectActuator -->|patches| K8sAPI
    EPP -.->|queue metrics via| Prometheus

    %% Downstream Consumers
    HPAKEDA["HPA / KEDA<br/>(external autoscaler)"]
    Prometheus -->|wva_desired_replicas| HPAKEDA
    HPAKEDA -->|scales| Deployments["Deployments / LWS"]

    style WVA fill:#e8f0fe,stroke:#4a90e2,stroke-width:2px
    style Controllers fill:#d5e8d4,stroke:#82b366
    style Engines fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#d6b656
    style Pipeline fill:#f8cecc,stroke:#b85450
    style Collectors fill:#dae8fc,stroke:#6c8ebf
    style Actuators fill:#e1d5e7,stroke:#9673a6
    style Prometheus fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#666
    style K8sAPI fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#666
    style vLLM fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#666
    style SGLang fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#666
    style EPP fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#666
    style HPAKEDA fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#666
